{% comment %} {% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium sticky product search bar for my Shopify store with the following requirements.
    
    ## Search Bar UI
    - Create a modern premium search bar.
    - Transparent background when the page loads.
    - While scrolling, smoothly change the background to solid white (#ffffff) with a subtle shadow and backdrop blur.
    - The search bar must always remain sticky at the top of the page.
    - Add smooth transition animations (0.3s–0.4s).
    - Fully responsive for Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile.
    - Use rounded corners, premium spacing, and clean typography.
    
    ## Search Functionality
    - Use Shopify Predictive Search API (NOT a custom search).
    - Show live product suggestions while typing.
    - Minimum 2 characters before searching.
    - Display results instantly without page refresh.
    - Debounce requests (250ms) to improve performance.
    
    ## Product Suggestions
    Each suggestion should include:
    - Product image
    - Product title
    - Price
    - Compare-at price (if available)
    - Vendor (optional)
    - Product availability
    - Link to the product page
    
    ## Search Dropdown
    - Premium dropdown with glassmorphism/light shadow.
    - Maximum height 450px.
    - Scrollable if more than 6 products.
    - Hover effect on each product.
    - Highlight the matching search text.
    - Show loading animation while fetching results.
    
    ## Empty State
    If no products are found, display:
    "No matching products found."
    
    Also show:
    - Popular products
    OR
    - Best Sellers
    
    ## Important Fix
    Currently the product recommendation/suggestion is NOT working.
    
    Fix the predictive search completely.
    
    When I search words related to any product (full or partial keyword), relevant products should immediately appear in the suggestion dropdown.
    
    Examples:
    Searching:
    - hp
    - toner
    - canon
    - ink
    - brother
    - samsung
    - epson
    
    should instantly suggest matching products.
    
    ## Performance
    - Do not reload the page.
    - Use AJAX + Shopify Predictive Search endpoint.
    - Optimize for speed.
    - Avoid duplicate requests.
    - Cache recent searches.
    
    ## Accessibility
    - Keyboard navigation (↑ ↓ Enter Esc)
    - Proper ARIA labels
    - Focus states
    
    ## Code Requirements
    - Shopify Liquid
    - Vanilla JavaScript (no jQuery)
    - Clean CSS
    - Separate HTML, CSS, and JS.
    - Do not modify existing theme functionality.
    - Create a reusable component/snippet.
    - Use unique class names to avoid conflicts.
    - Compatible with Shopify 2.0 themes.
    
    The final result should look like a premium Apple/Stripe-style sticky search experience with instant product suggestions and a smooth transparent-to-solid header transition while scrolling.
{% enddoc %} {% endcomment %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-premium-search-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 9;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    background-color: transparent;
    backdrop-filter: blur(0px);
    box-shadow: none;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-{{ ai_gen_id }}.scrolled {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.scrolled_bg_color }};
    backdrop-filter: blur({{ block.settings.backdrop_blur }}px);
    
  }

  .ai-premium-search-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 90%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: {{ block.settings.vertical_padding }}px {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding }}px;
        display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
  }
.desktop-tran{
  display:flex;
  gap: 5px;
}
  .ai-premium-search-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 75%;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-input-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.input_bg_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.input_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.input_padding }}px {{ block.settings.input_padding | times: 1.5 }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-input-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-within {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_border_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.1 }};
  }

  .ai-premium-search-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-right: 12px;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    background: transparent;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.input_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_color }};
  }

  .ai-premium-search-clear-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-left: 8px;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-clear-{{ ai_gen_id }}.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-clear-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-loading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    margin-left: 8px;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-loading-{{ ai_gen_id }}.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-spinner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.icon_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.2 }};
    border-top-color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: ai-premium-search-spin-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-premium-search-spin-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .ai-premium-search-dropdown-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + 12px);
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dropdown_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.dropdown_border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.dropdown_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    backdrop-filter: blur({{ block.settings.dropdown_backdrop_blur }}px);
    max-height: {{ block.settings.dropdown_max_height }}px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-dropdown-{{ ai_gen_id }}.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-premium-search-dropdown-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-dropdown-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-dropdown-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: {{ block.settings.icon_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.3 }};
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-results-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .ai-premium-search-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
